#: includes/admin/settings/class-wpsms-settings.php:465
msgid ""
"Enhance user privacy with GDPR-focused settings. Activate to ensure "
"compliance with data protection regulations and provide users with "
"transparency and control over their personal information."
msgstr ""
"حریم خصوصی کاربران را با تنظیمات متمرکز بر GDPR تقویت کنید. این گزینه را "
