"کاربران شفافیت و کنترل بیشتری بر اطلاعات شخصی‌شان ارائه دهید."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-wpsms-settings.php:471
msgid "GDPR Compliance Enhancements"
msgstr "انطباق با GDPR"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-wpsms-settings.php:474
msgid ""
"Implements GDPR adherence by enabling user data export and deletion via "
"mobile number and adding a consent checkbox for SMS newsletter subscriptions."
